vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ يَا إِبْلِيسُ مَا مَنَعَكَ أَن تَسْجُدَ لِمَا خَلَقْتُ بِيَدَيَّ أَسْتَكْبَرْتَ أَمْ كُنتَ مِنَ الْعَالِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">[Allāh] said, &quot;O Iblees, what prevented you from prostrating to that which I created with My hands? Were you arrogant [then], or were you [already] among the haughty?&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أنه مخلوق بيدي الله تعالى كما قال تعالى: {ما منعك أن تسجد لما خلقت بيدي}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/6</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهنا أضاف الفعل إليه فقال: {لما خلقت} ثم قال: {بيدي}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 3/45</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s38a75\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/38-54.html\">Previous verse (38:54)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/38-76.html\">Next verse (38:76)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <b lang=\"en\">English</b> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <a href=\"/id/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"id\" lang=\"id\" data-l=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/38-75.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">فارسی</a> · <a href